---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | d4lanis"
  description="Privacy Policy for mi-ai-agent, an experimental AI chatbot that operates through WhatsApp. Learn what information is processed, how it is used, and how to request deletion."
  path="/privacy-policy"
  current="privacy-policy"
>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="updated">Last updated: September 21, 2026</p>

  <p class="lead">
    This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>mi-ai-agent</strong> (the &ldquo;Application&rdquo;) handles
    information. The Application is an experimental AI chatbot that allows people to interact with an
    artificial intelligence assistant through WhatsApp. It is operated by Daniel Alanis as an
    independent developer.
  </p>

  <nav aria-label="Contents">
    <ul class="legal-links">
      <li><a href="#information">Information We Process</a></li>
      <li><a href="#use">How We Use Information</a></li>
      <li><a href="#third-parties">Third-Party Processing</a></li>
      <li><a href="#security">Data Security</a></li>
      <li><a href="#retention">Data Retention</a></li>
      <li><a href="#rights">Your Rights</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <h2 id="information">1. Information We Process</h2>
  <p>
    When you use the Application, the following information may be processed in order to operate the
    chatbot:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Messages you send.</strong> The content of the messages you send to the chatbot, so that
      it can understand and respond to your request.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Your WhatsApp phone number.</strong> When necessary, the phone number associated with your
      WhatsApp account is processed so that the service can receive and reply to your messages.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Technical information.</strong> Basic technical data required to process your requests and
      keep the service working, such as message timestamps and delivery or error information.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    The Application does not ask for, and is not designed to process, sensitive categories of
    information. Please do not send sensitive personal information through the chatbot.
  </p>

  <h2 id="use">2. How We Use Information</h2>
  <p>The information described above is used only to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Process your messages and generate replies;</li>
    <li>Operate and maintain the chatbot;</li>
    <li>Diagnose errors, troubleshoot problems, and improve how the Application works.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Information is not used for advertising, and it is not used to build profiles beyond what is
    necessary to operate the chatbot.
  </p>

  <h2 id="third-parties">3. Third-Party Processing</h2>
  <p>
    To provide its functionality, the Application relies on third-party services, such as messaging and
    AI/cloud infrastructure providers. Your messages may be transmitted to and processed by these
    services strictly as needed to generate responses and operate the chatbot.
  </p>
  <p>
    These providers process information under their own terms and privacy policies. The specific
    providers and configurations may change over time as the Application evolves.
  </p>

  <h2 id="sale">4. No Sale of Personal Information</h2>
  <p>
    We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. Information is not shared with third
    parties except as described in this policy or when required by law.
  </p>

  <h2 id="security">5. Data Security</h2>
  <p>
    Reasonable measures are taken to protect the information processed by the Application. However, no
    method of transmission or storage is completely secure, and the Application is an experimental
    project, so it cannot guarantee absolute security.
  </p>

  <h2 id="retention">6. Data Retention</h2>
  <p>
    Information is kept only for as long as it is reasonably necessary to operate and maintain the
    chatbot, to troubleshoot issues, and to comply with applicable obligations. After that, it is
    deleted or anonymized using the retention practices applicable to the services used to run the
    Application.
  </p>

  <h2 id="rights">7. Your Rights and Deletion Requests</h2>
  <p>
    You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of the information associated with your
    interaction with the Application. To submit a request, please follow the instructions on the
    <a href="/data-deletion">Data Deletion</a> page.
  </p>
  <div class="note">
    Requests are handled by email at
    <a href="mailto:daniel.alanis.hdz@gmail.com">daniel.alanis.hdz@gmail.com</a>.
  </div>

  <h2 id="changes">8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>
    This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time. When it is updated, the &ldquo;Last
    updated&rdquo; date at the top of this page will be revised.
  </p>

  <h2 id="contact">9. Contact</h2>
  <div class="contact-box">
    <p>
      If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or about how the Application handles information,
      you can contact:
    </p>
    <p>
      Daniel Alanis — Independent Developer<br />
      Email: <a href="mailto:daniel.alanis.hdz@gmail.com">daniel.alanis.hdz@gmail.com</a>
    </p>
  </div>

  <a class="back-link" href="/">&larr; Back to d4lanis.com</a>
</LegalLayout>
